  "published": true,
  "story": "海边电台收到的消息里混入了一些井号噪声。Ottly 想删去所有 #，其余字母和空格都原样保留，不能顺便删掉首尾空格或改变消息顺序。请帮她恢复这段消息。",
  "teaching": [
    {
      "title": "本题练习重点",
      "text": "逐字符筛选并拼接字符串；过滤噪声同时保留空格、顺序和空结果的换行。",
      "example": "先运行样例，再检查空数据、边界值和每个分支。"
    }
  ],
  "description": "输入一行长度为 0–100 的文本，只含大写英文字母、空格和 #。逐字符检查，删除所有 #，将其余字符按原顺序组成新字符串并输出一行。保留所有原有空格；空输入或全部为 # 时输出一个空行，不附其他文字。",
  "starter_code": "# 在这里编写 Python 代码\n",
  "examples": [
    {
      "stdin": "A#B## C\n",
      "stdout": "AB C\n"
    }
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "case_id": "sample-1",
      "stdin": "A#B## C\n",
      "expected_output": "AB C\n",
      "visibility": "public"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "hidden-1",
      "stdin": "\n",
      "expected_output": "\n",
      "visibility": "hidden"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "hidden-2",
      "stdin": "###\n",
      "expected_output": "\n",
      "visibility": "hidden"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "hidden-3",
      "stdin": "  A# B  \n",
      "expected_output": "  A B  \n",
      "visibility": "hidden"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "hidden-4",
      "stdin": "####################################################################################################\n",
      "expected_output": "\n",
      "visibility": "hidden"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "hidden-5",
      "stdin": "#################################################A##################################################\n",
      "expected_output": "A\n",
      "visibility": "hidden"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "hidden-6",
      "stdin": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\n",
      "expected_output": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\n",
      "visibility": "hidden"
    }
  ],
  "comparison": "exact",
  "time_limit_seconds": 3,
  "output_limit_chars": 8000,
  "hints": {
    "level1": "哪些字符需要删去，哪些字符即使看起来空白也要保留？",
    "level2": "遍历原文本，只在字符不是噪声标记时追加到结果。",
    "level3": "检查首尾空格、连续井号和全部为井号的输入，区分空行与完全无输出。"
  },
  "reference_solution": "message = input()\nresult = \"\"\n\nfor char in message:\n    if char != \"#\":\n        result = result + char\n\nprint(result)\n",
  "solution_explanation": "使用空字符串保存结果，只把不是 # 的字符追加进去。空格同样是应保留的字符，不能对输入调用 strip 来消除首尾空格。最后使用一次 print，即使结果为空也会输出题目要求的一个空行。"
}
